# Google AI Studio API Key (Free Tier — $0 cost for gemini-3.8-flash-tts)
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and paste your key below:
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_google_ai_studio_key_here

# Quick commands (run from repository root in PowerShell):
# 1. Preview 6 showcase sentences across A1 & A2 (~15 seconds):
#    node scripts/generate-tts.mjs --sample 6
#
# 2. Generate / resume full A1 + A2 expressive audio bank (skips existing MP3s, prunes edited typos):
#    node scripts/generate-tts.mjs
#
# 3. Re-record a single sentence or unit with --force:
#    node scripts/generate-tts.mjs --match "feeling really tired" --force
